8. a6 b3 9. a7 b2 10. a8=Q $11 b1=Q $11 11. Qe8 $1 Kd6 12. Qf8 Kc7 13. Qe7 Kc6 14. Qe6 Kc7 15. Kh5 $1 { and White won. } ) 
2. Ke3 ( { More demanding than } 2. g5 a5 3. bxa5 Kxa5 4. h4 b4 { with a draw. } ) 
