Ka4 $1 { King first. } ( { a) The straightforward } 4... b4 $2 { failed to } 5. Kd3 Ka4 6. Kc2 Ka3 7. Kb1 ) 
 ( { b) while } 4... Kb6 $2 { also loses to } 5. h4 Kc5 6. h5 Kd5 7. g6 hxg6 8. h6 { - Muller. } ) 
5. h4 ( { Or } 5. Kd2 Ka3 6. Kc2 Ka2 $1 7. Kc3 Ka3 { , repeating moves. } ) 
b4 6. h5 b3 7. Kd2 Ka3 $1 8. g6 hxg6 9. hxg6 b2 10. g7 b1=Q 11. g8=Q { Draw. } 
