 ( { b) } 4... Kh3 { leads to a skewer on the g-file after } 5. b6 g3 6. b7 g2 7. b8=Q $11 g1=Q $11 8. Qh8 $1 ) 
 ( { c) while } 4... Kf3 { fails to } 5. Ke1 $1 g3 6. Kf1 { , which is why only 1.Kd2! works. } ) 
5. b6 g3 6. b7 g2 7. b8=Q g1=Q 8. Qb6+ Kg2 9. Qxg1+ Kxg1 10. Kc3 { White wins by one tempo. } Kf2 11. Kb3 Ke3 12. Kxa3 Ke4 13. Kb4 Ke5 14. Kc5 
