 { With his active king White is obviously better, but how to make progress? Ftacnik concluded that winning on a single flank is impossible and, after some calculation, opted for a pawn race. } 1. { -KEY- } Kc5 $1 e5 2. g5+ ( { Simpler was } 2. fxe5 Kxe5 3. Kb6 Kf4 4. Kxa6 Kxg4 5. Kxb5 Kxh5 6. Kc4 $1 { (we are already familiar with this method from the previous examples) } ( { in contrast } 6. a4 $2 { would just draw after } g5 ) 
