Kf5 3. fxe5 Kxe5 4. Kb6 Kf5 5. h6 { In order to delay Black's race. This must have been White's idea when playing 2.g5+. } ( { However, } 5. Kxa6 { was much simpler; i.e. } Kxg5 6. Kxb5 Kxh5 7. Kc4 $1 { and we are back in the previous note. } ) 
