14. Qf5 Kh4 15. Qf6 Kh3 ( { a2) or } 15... Kh5 16. Qe5 $1 { , transposing to 13...Kh5 etc. } ) 
16. Qc3 $1 Kh2 17. Qe5 { and the exchange of queens proves inevitable. } ) 
8. Kc4 g5 9. Kd3 Kh4 10. b5 g4 11. b6 g3 12. b7 { Ftacnik has seen that he can force the queen exchange after the dual promotion. } ( { Of course } 12. Ke3 Kh3 13. b7 g2 14. Kf2 $1 { was also possible. } ) 
g2 13. b8=Q g1=Q 14. Qf4+ Kh5 ( { Or } 14... Kh3 15. Qe3 ) 
15. Qe5+ $1 ( { Black resigned, seeing that after } 15. Qe5 Kxh6 { (or } Kh4 16. Qd4 { in similar fashion) } 16. Qe3 $1 Qxe3 17. Kxe3 { , only the White pawn queens. } ) 

